# The saved games, and the menus that leave a GOSUB routine by Esc or by a letter, which once
# stopped the game with "RETURN without GOSUB" (docs/devnotes.md, item 9). Esc at "SAVEGAME
# FILE TO LOAD"; an unused saved game chosen by its letter; 1st Manassas (BULLRUN1.CIV) played
# for three commands, saved in the second slot and loaded again; Quit answered by Esc and by
# the letter of Not Yet. It checks the saved file, which holds the fixed date of a script.
#! seed 3
#! files scenarios/$AVE2.CIV

rule 1 key space
rule 2:C key enter
rule 2:P key enter
rule 2:S key enter

# Load File; $AVE5.CIV, one down from $AVE1.CIV, which the list highlights first; Enter; Esc at
# the saved games.
play until 2:M
digest
key enter
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
prompt
digest
key esc

# Load File, $AVE5.CIV, and the first saved game chosen by its letter: it is unused.
play until 2:M
digest
key enter
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
prompt
text $

# Load File, BULLRUN1.CIV; Fight; three commands rest; F10.
play until 2:M
digest
key enter
prompt
key down
prompt
key down
prompt
key down
prompt
key down
prompt
key right
prompt
key enter
play until 2:M
key enter
repeat 3
play until 5
key space
end
play until 5
digest
key f10

# Save File, the second slot.
play until 2:M
digest
text s
prompt
digest
key down
prompt
key enter

# Load File, two up from Fight (its entry now names the file loaded), $AVE5.CIV, then the
# second saved game, three up from the fifth, which the menu highlights; Fight.
play until 2:M
digest
key up
prompt
key up
prompt
key enter
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
prompt
digest
repeat 3
key up
prompt
end
key enter
play until 2:M
digest
key enter
play until 5
digest
key f10

# Quit: Esc; Quit: Not Yet, by its letter; Quit: Yes.
play until 2:M
text q
prompt
digest
key esc
play until 2:M
text q
prompt
text n
play until 2:M
digest
text q
prompt
text y
repeat space
